<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-SBC Warburg upgrades Glaxo.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-SBC Warburg upgrades Glaxo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg upgraded its recommendation on Glaxo Plc to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; on Thursday, market sources said.</p>
<p>Glaxo shares were four pence weaker at 988 by 1003 GMT.</p>
<p>Analysts at SBC Warburg were not immediately avaialable to comment.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
